  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 538.07 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid shall be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #7657, eff 3-5-02, EXPIRED: 3-5-10\n\nNew. #9737, eff 6-25-10, EXPIRED: 6-25-18\n\nNew. #12783, eff 5-21-19",
